# Design Requirements – Fixed M18 Proximity Sensor Bracket

## 1. Project Overview

The objective of this project is to design and manufacture a fixed-position mounting bracket for a standard M18 cylindrical proximity sensor.

The bracket will be designed using CAD software and manufactured using FDM additive manufacturing.

The project will demonstrate a complete engineering workflow from requirements definition through CAD design, additive manufacture, inspection, testing, and design review.

---

## 2. Design Objectives

The bracket shall:

- Securely hold a standard M18 cylindrical proximity sensor.
- Maintain the sensor in a fixed position during normal use.
- Allow the sensor to be installed and removed without damaging the bracket.
- Be manufactured using FDM additive manufacturing.
- Use commonly available metric fasteners.
- Be simple to manufacture and assemble.
- Minimise the requirement for support material during printing.
- Be suitable for mounting to a machine frame, test rig, or aluminium extrusion.

---

