---

## 12. Design Review and Revision

A design review shall be completed after manufacture and testing.

Any issues identified shall be documented.

Potential revisions may include:

- Sensor bore tolerance adjustment.
- Increased wall thickness.
- Increased fillet radius.
- Modified mounting hole dimensions.
- Improved cable clearance.
- Improved print orientation.
- Reduced material usage.

A revised component should be produced if significant improvements are identified.

